      "type": "tutorial",
      "heading": "Bulk Assign (Penugasan Massal)",
      "id": "bulk-assign",
      "intro": "Fitur Bulk Assign memungkinkan seorang Supervisor atau Analyst Lead untuk mendistribusikan banyak alert **yang belum ditugaskan (Unassigned)** ke satu analis tertentu secara sekaligus.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "num": 1,
          "title": "Aktivasi Mode & Syarat Alert",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• **Aktivasi:** Pilih opsi `Bulk Assign` dari menu opsi (titik tiga) di toolbar utama.\n• **Syarat Alert:** Tabel secara otomatis hanya akan menampilkan alert yang memenuhi syarat: `Belum di-assign`, `Belum diklasifikasi`, dan `Tidak sedang di-lock`.\n• Centang alert yang ingin Anda tugaskan, lalu klik `Assign Selected` di Action Bar atas.",
          "color": "#3b82f6",
          "bg": "#eff6ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(59,130,246,.15);border:1px solid #bfdbfe;background:#fff;padding:16px;\"><div style=\"background:#f8fafc;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:12px;\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Bulk Assign Mode Active</div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;\"><button style=\"padding:6px 12px;border-radius:6px;background:#f1f5f9;color:#64748b;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;\">Cancel</button><button style=\"padding:6px 12px;border-radius:6px;background:#2563eb;color:#fff;border:none;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;\">Assign Selected (3)</button></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:10px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:8px;\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked style=\"width:16px;height:16px;accent-color:#2563eb;\"/><div style=\"flex:1;\"><div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:#0f172a;\">#10293 - Suspected Fraud</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#64748b;margin-top:2px;\">Currently Unassigned</div></div></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "Dialog Konfigurasi Penugasan",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Setelah menekan `Assign Selected`, sebuah dialog formulir akan muncul.\n• **Pilih Assignee:** Pilih nama investigator yang akan ditugaskan dari dropdown (biasanya mengambil data dari API `GetAlertAssignUser`).\n• Pastikan jumlah alert yang tertulis sesuai dengan yang Anda pilih. Klik `Submit` untuk menjalankan penugasan.",
          "color": "#10b981",
          "bg": "#f0fdf4",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.15);border:1px solid #e2e8f0;background:#fff;width:320px;margin:0 auto;\"><div style=\"padding:16px;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><div style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:800;color:#0f172a;\">Bulk Assign Alerts</div></div><div style=\"padding:20px;\"><div style=\"background:#eff6ff;padding:12px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #bfdbfe;margin-bottom:16px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;\"><div style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:#2563eb;\">3</div><div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:#1e40af;\">Alerts selected for assignment</div></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;\"><div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#475569;\">Assign To <span style=\"color:#ef4444;\">*</span></div><div style=\"padding:10px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:8px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#0f172a;\">Investigator_02 (invest02)</span><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M6 9l6 6 6-6\"/></svg></div></div></div><div style=\"padding:16px;border-top:1px solid #f1f5f9;display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;gap:10px;background:#f8fafc;\"><button style=\"padding:8px 16px;border-radius:8px;background:#fff;color:#64748b;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;\">Cancel</button><button style=\"padding:8px 16px;border-radius:8px;background:#2563eb;color:#fff;border:none;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;\">Submit Assignment</button></div></div>"
